+
+The result is rejected as an animation solution. The source images were not
+drawn for a cutout rig: their canvas offsets and static pivots do not establish
+visible joints, a shared foot line or changing contact points. The pose clips
+then tween each part independently, so body weight, joint continuity and
+grounding drift even though the hierarchy itself is technically valid.
